                                                "sense_id": "05d36f60-598e-3f26-aaae-3f8a36824e9a",
                                                "text": "If you need to reload film, the cassette can be rewound slightly by turning the hub located on one end of its spool."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "570cbd41-5086-360b-9a64-818071c40597",
                                        "entry_id": "4a02f635-ab87-3ad8-89b7-941aec64243e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of the rotating assemblies of a gas turbine engine, composed of one or more turbine stages, a shaft, and one or more compressor or fan stages."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16b9983b-5398-4888-ae7e-617386519007",
                                                "sense_id": "570cbd41-5086-360b-9a64-818071c40597",
                                                "text": "The high-pressure spool rotates faster than the intermediate- and low-pressure spools, as the high-pressure turbine is driven by superheated combustion gases straight out of the burners, while the high-pressure compressor has to spin very fast to compress air that has already been compressed and heated by the low- and intermediate-pressure compressors."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
